### Product list
GET http://localhost:8001/products

### Reserve two mice
POST http://localhost:8001/products/1/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### Place order (201 and CONFIRMED when all services are running)
POST http://localhost:8000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Asha","items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":2},{"productId":4,"quantity":1}],"payment":{"method":"CARD","cardNumber":"4111111111111111"}}

### Declined order (402 and PAYMENT_FAILED; stock is restored)
POST http://localhost:8000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Asha","items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":1}],"payment":{"method":"CARD","cardNumber":"4111111111110000"}}

### Product not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8001/products/999

### Payment health
GET http://localhost:8003/health
